{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":97691,"duration_api_ms":136940,"num_turns":15,"result":"The review is complete. All acceptance criteria are met:\n\n- **6 named test functions** with descriptive doc comments covering all required scenarios\n- **Shared fixtures** extracted to `tank_core::test_fixtures` (no duplication)\n- **Shrimp death -> detritus routing** explicitly asserted via trace deltas\n- **Export actions** properly distinguished from internal routing\n- **TOL = 1e-6** used consistently\n- **Detail-level tracing** enabled in all tests with trace dump on failure\n- **E2e runner** produces summary report and exits non-zero on failure\n- **Both N and C** checked in all scenarios\n- All tests pass, clippy clean, formatting clean","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"28775b5d-397f-4d50-b78b-223d234cfc3f","total_cost_usd":0.63809785,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49731,"cache_read_input_tokens":221693,"output_tokens":3292,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49731,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":66,"outputTokens":7095,"cacheReadInputTokens":387241,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47870,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1341026,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":3292,"cacheReadInputTokens":221693,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49731,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.50399525,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 6 conservation_regression tests pass: grazing, feeding, mortality/senescence, trim-and-remove, trim-and-leave, water-change (6 passed, 0 failed).","E2e conservation suite passes all 6 scenarios: closed-system scenarios (grazing, feeding, mortality_senescence, trim_and_leave) show +0.000000000 drift; open-system scenarios (trim_and_remove: dN=-38.5, dC=-240.625; water_change: dN=+21.1875, dC=+97.5) show expected import/export deltas.","cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_harness -- -D warnings passes cleanly with no warnings.","cargo fmt --all --check passes with no formatting issues.","Shared test_fixtures module exists at crates/tank_core/src/test_fixtures.rs (317 lines), exported as `pub mod test_fixtures` from lib.rs. Both conservation_regression.rs and e2e_conservation.rs import all 5 fixtures + dump_trace_to_subdir from this module. No duplicated local fixture definitions remain.","All 6 tests have descriptive doc comments: grazing (lines 139-146), feeding (lines 207-217), mortality (lines 290-301), trim-remove (lines 385-391), trim-leave (lines 474-479), water-change (lines 562-571).","TOL = 1e-6 used consistently across all conservation checks, satisfying the '<1e-6 mg per tick for deterministic runs' criterion.","All 6 tests call enable_tracing(&mut engine) with Detail verbosity; failures dump JSONL trace to /tmp/tank_conservation_traces/ or /tmp/tank_conservation_e2e_traces/ via assert_or_dump/assert_close_or_dump/assert_trace_delta helpers.","Export actions tracked via is_open_system_action_label() covering feed, water_change, siphon_detritus, add_shrimp, remove_shrimp, and trim_plants_and_remove — distinct from internal routing.","Trim-and-remove test (line 393) verifies budget entry for action:trim_plants_and_remove shows net negative N and C (explicit export). Water-change test (line 573) verifies gross import/export flows match expected source water concentrations × exchanged volume.","Mortality/senescence test has 6 assert_trace_delta calls including system:daily_shrimp -> animal.adults (delta < 0) and system:daily_shrimp -> detritus.fine_g (delta > 0), explicitly verifying shrimp death routing to fine detritus.","E2e runner produces formatted ASCII summary table (pass/fail per scenario with dN/dC magnitudes) and exits non-zero on failure via assert_eq!(failed_count, 0, ...).","Water-change fixture seeds non-zero source.nitrite_mg_n_per_l = 0.25, exercising the nitrite import term end-to-end.","Both N and C are checked in all 6 scenarios (feeding pathway assertions include DIC/nitrate trace deltas for carbon and nitrogen respectively)."],"findings_or_gaps":["The test_fixtures module is exported unconditionally (`pub mod test_fixtures` in lib.rs) rather than behind `#[cfg(test)]` or a feature gate. This means the fixture code is compiled into release builds. While not a correctness issue, gating it behind `#[cfg(test)]` or a `test-support` feature would be cleaner. This is minor and does not block approval.","The e2e trim-and-remove and trim-and-leave scenarios do not include trace-level pathway assertions (only total-mass and budget-entry checks). The conservation_regression.rs counterparts also lack trim-specific trace assertions. This is acceptable given that trimming is a single discrete action rather than a multi-step routing chain, but it is worth noting for future coverage expansion."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Consider gating `pub mod test_fixtures` behind `#[cfg(any(test, feature = \"test-support\"))]` so fixture code is excluded from release builds. This is a minor housekeeping item, not a blocking concern."],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"e9ec1f59-89a5-4a9b-a349-9a7bb08cb615"}
